        },
        {
          "text": " can be used to "
        },
        {
          "text": "prevent hostile creatures from spawning",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " in a 32 block radius cube centered the candle. \n\n"
        },
        {
          "text": "They must be lit",
          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": " with flint and steel, a fire spell, or a flame cantrip to function. They can be extinguished by activating them. When extinguished, they will not prevent monsters from spawning."
